  `sha256:b08a12e876baa8a5ccadd1ebbe346fe7267dba3b1c9f4fd6bb02070fae41ab6c`
  and ARM64 child
  `sha256:fb7f91836fd95f382a5a04af740d859e2e9731804b5c0ba43f5d2e7f9ad64794`.
- Wrote one selected rebase plan and exact migration map before source
  implementation. Preserved deployed fork IDs 197–199, assign upstream IDs
  200–215, and move the not-yet-deployed fork migration to 216.
- Added an exact migration inventory and overlay pin regression. Expected RED
  on the pre-upgrade source: both tests fail because the inventory ends with
  fork migration 200 and both overlay pins still identify the previous digest.
- Code Simplifier found no useful simplification in the focused test; its
  explicit expected inventory and two pin assertions keep release identity
  visible. `git diff --cached --check` passes for the package checkpoint.
- Source rebase, conflict review, GREEN checks, independent review, and local
  implementation commit remain pending. No image was pulled or built, no
  runtime/database was touched, and nothing was pushed or merged.

